@page "/about"

<PageTitle>Starchives</PageTitle>

<div class="container px-0 py-4">

    <!-- Jumbotron card containing all sections between header and footer -->
    <div class="col p-4 text-white bg-dark rounded-3">

        <!-- Container for columns in upper half of card -->
        <div class="d-flex container-fluid">

            <!-- Project statement -->
            <div id="projectStatement" class="p-4 container-fluid purpose">
                <h4 class="heading-md text-start">The Problem</h4>
                <p class="text-start indent">
                    As of November 2025, there are nearly 2000 uploads on the Star Citizen YouTube
                    channel, ranging anywhere from 30 seconds to over an hour in length. When discussing the game,
                    people will often quote a developer or bring up topics mentioned in one or more videos uploaded
                    years ago. With multiple weekly uploads over the years, so much has been spoken by CIG that people
                    wanting to provide sources for their info will have an exceedingly difficult time doing so if
                    they don't know the particular video.
                </p>

                <h4 class="heading-md text-start">The Solution</h4>
                <p class="text-start indent">
                    With the help of YouTube's auto-generated captions (and those provided by CIG, when available),
                    this changes. This site allows anyone to search a database of all videos on the Star Citizen channel
                    and their associated captions to quickly find the info they're searching for. Timestamps to all
                    occurrences are provided for search terms that have a match. Searching for any
                    mention of server meshing, bespoke, or ships that punch above their weight class should now take minutes, not hours,
                    of combing through videos. Additionally, video stats are provided so anyone can see which
                    videos have been the most far-reaching, what the community has been most interested in, and more.
                </p>

                <h4 class="heading-md text-start">Additional Benefits</h4>
                <p class="text-start indent">
                    This site is also a quick access hub for many Star Citizen info resources that anyone may
                    find useful at one time or another. At the bottom of the page, you'll find external links to several official RSI materials, as
                    well as some of my favorite Star Citizen community projects, containing particularly useful information about all
                    aspects of the game and its development.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ -->
            <div id="faq" class="py-4 px-5 container-fluid">
                <h3 class="heading-md">FAQ</h3>
                <!-- Questions are appended to this accordion -->
                <div id="faqAccordion" class="mx-auto w-100 accordion accordion-flush">
                    @for (int i = 0; i < Questions.Count; i++)
                    {
                        var q = Questions[i];
                        <div id="@($"q{i}")" class="bg-dark pt-3 accordion-item">

                            <h2 id="@($"header-q{i}")" class="accordion-header">
                                <button class="bg-dark bg-gradient text-white accordion-button collapsed d-flex"
                                        type="button"
                                        data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                        data-bs-target="@($"#collapse-q{i}")"
                                        aria-controls="@($"collapse-q{i}")"
                                        aria-expanded="false">

                                    <div class="accordion-header-text flex-grow-1">
                                        @q.Title
                                    </div>
                                </button>
                            </h2>

                            <div id="@($"collapse-q{i}")"
                                 class="bg-secondary accordion-collapse collapse"
                                 aria-labelledby="@($"header-q{i}")">

                                <!-- ensure body text is high-contrast against bg-dark -->
                                <div id="@($"body-q{i}")" class="bg-dark accordion-body text-start text-white">
                                    <p class="ps-4 text-white">
                                        @((MarkupString)q.AnswerHtml)
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    }
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <hr>

        <!-- Container for personal statement -->
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-start">

            <!-- Personal statement -->
            <div id="authorStatement" class="p-2 container-fluid devNote">
                <h5 class="text-start">Developer's Note</h5>

                <p class="text-start statement">
                    Thanks for visiting my site. The passionate developers at CIG and the Star Citizen community
                    both inspire my pursuit of software development goals. This site was  among the first of many fruits that
                    continue to result from that inspiration.
                    <br><br>
                    If you found this site helpful as a prospective player, consider signing up at RSI with my referral code:
                    <br><br>
                    <a href="https://www.robertsspaceindustries.com/enlist?referral=STAR-NRZ7-WNLV">STAR-NRZ7-WNLV</a>
                    <br><br>
                    If you have any questions or feedback, feel free to contact me <a href="mailto:admin@starchives.org">here</a>
                    or use the box to the right.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="vr"></div>

            <!-- Contact section -->
            <div id="contactSection" class="py-2 px-4 container-fluid justify-content-center">

                <form id="contactWindow" class="needs-validation" novalidate @onsubmit="OnSubmit" @onsubmit:preventDefault>

                    <!-- Contact form submit button -->
                    <button id="contactButton" class="btn btn-light" type="submit" disabled="@IsSending">
                        <h5 id="contactButtonLabel" class="heading-md">@ContactButtonLabel</h5>
                    </button>
                    <div id="sendingIcon" class="spinner-grow spinner-grow-sm float-end" role="status" aria-hidden="true" style="visibility:@(IsSending ? "visible" : "hidden")"></div>

                    <div id="contactResults" class="justify-content-center mt-2">
                        @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(ContactResultHtml))
                        {
                            <div>@((MarkupString)ContactResultHtml)</div>
                        }
                    </div>

                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-6 text-start mb-2">
                            <label for="contactInputName" class="form-label">Contact Info:</label>
                            <input type="text"
                                   class="form-control form-control-sm @(IsNameInvalid ? "is-invalid" : null)"
                                   id="contactInputName"
                                   placeholder="Email / Discord (if reply is desired)"
                                   maxlength="64"
                                   @bind="ContactName"
                                   @oninput="ClearNameInvalid"
                                   required>
                            <div class="invalid-feedback">
                                Contact info field cannot be empty.
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="col-6 text-start mb-2">
                            <label for="contactSelectTopic" class="form-label">Topic:</label>
                            <select class="form-select form-select-sm @(IsTopicInvalid ? "is-invalid" : null)"
                                    id="contactSelectTopic"
                                    aria-label=".form-select-sm"
                                    @bind="ContactTopic"
                                    required>
                                <option value="" selected>Select a topic</option>
                                <option value="Suggestion">Suggestion</option>
                                <option value="Question">Question</option>
                                <option value="Comment">Comment</option>
                                <option value="Bug Report">Bug Report</option>
                                <option value="Other">Other</option>
                            </select>
                            <div class="invalid-feedback">
                                Topic must be selected.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="text-start mb-2">
                        <label for="contactInputContent" class="form-label">Feedback:</label>
                        <textarea class="form-control form-control-sm @(IsContentInvalid ? "is-invalid" : null)"
                                  id="contactInputContent"
                                  rows="2"
                                  placeholder="Questions, comments, something else? Write it here!"
                                  maxlength="512"
                                  @bind="ContactMessage"
                                  @oninput="ClearContentInvalid"
                                  required></textarea>
                        <div class="invalid-feedback">
                            Feedback field cannot be empty.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </form>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</div>